                      <p class="attach-item__note">{item.note}</p>
                      <p class="attach-item__best">{item.best}</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                ))}
              </div>

              <p>
                Read as a ladder: the bag buys protection, the header card buys
                a peg, the backing card buys a shelf presence, and the box buys
                an opening. Each step up costs more in material, in assembly
                time, and in the volume it takes on a pallet.
              </p>
            </section>

            <!-- ---------- 08 ---------- -->
            <section
              id="pack-premium"
              class="attach-section"
              data-article-section="pack-premium"
