              <header class="attach-section__header">
                <span class="attach-section__index">08</span>
                <div>
                  <p class="attach-section__eyebrow">Packaging</p>
                  <h2>The presentation tier</h2>
                </div>
              </header>

              <p>
                Above the working tiers, packaging starts doing something else:
                it sets the price the piece can carry, and it becomes part of
                what the buyer keeps. That is a different budget, and it should
                be decided separately.
              </p>

              <div class="attach-grid">
                {packPremium.map((item) => (
                  <div class="attach-item">
                    <div class="attach-item__media">
                      {item.src ? (
                        <Image
                          src={item.src}
                          alt={item.name}
                          width={192}
                          height={192}
                          loading="lazy"
