                    </p>
                    <p>
                      <span>Test</span>
                      {item.test}
                    </p>
                    <p>
                      <span>Ask</span>
                      {item.ask}
                    </p>
                  </div>
                ))}
              </div>

              <p>
                The practical test of a report is whether it names the part. A
                certificate that names the factory, or the material, or a
                generic “sample”, tells you nothing about the batch in your
                hand. What you want is the part number, the test method, the
                laboratory, and the date — and the same four things on the next
                order.
              </p>

              <div class="attach-note">
                <p class="attach-note__label">Where wear and compliance meet</p>
                <p class="attach-note__foot">
                  Nickel release is a wear question in disguise. The barrier
                  layer sits under the colour, so a finish that has worn through
                  at the rim is also a finish that has exposed what the
                  regulation is about. That is why the care advice in deep dive
                  04 is not only cosmetic.
                </p>
              </div>
            </section>

            <!-- ---------- CLOSING ---------- -->
            <footer class="attach-conclusion">
              <div class="attach-conclusion__rule"></div>
              <p class="attach-conclusion__label">The decision</p>

              <div class="attach-rule">
                <p>
                  <strong>Choose the attachment by fabric and frequency.</strong>
                  Not by the look of the back, which nobody sees, and not by the
                  few cents between one clutch and another.
                </p>
                <p>
                  <strong>Choose packaging by the moment of handover.</strong>
                  A bag protects, a card sells, a box gives. Decide which moment
                  matters before pricing the box.
                </p>
                <p>
                  <strong>Ask for the report on the part.</strong> Compliance
                  lives in the attachment and the plating, so the document has
                  to name them.
                </p>
              </div>

              <p class="attach-conclusion__text">
                If the program mixes product families — pins for the giveaway,
                keychains for retail, cufflinks for the gift tier — send the whole
                set at once. The hardware and the packaging are cheaper to
                standardise across a program than to optimise one product at a
                time.
              </p>

              <div class="attach-conclusion__signature">
